  "title": "Fig, Mustard, and Champagne-Glazed Chicken Breasts",
  "description": "Chicken breasts are glazed with a zesty and sweet fig, Dijon, and Champagne vinaigrette sauce in this quick and easy dinner recipe that's sure to impress guests.",
